+From f571fd73a119c74dcdbd988dc07837fb1853b642 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: =?UTF-8?q?Kacper=20Michaj=C5=82ow?= <kasper93@gmail.com>
+Date: Wed, 18 Feb 2026 05:04:01 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH] vf_d3d11vpp: print supported custom rates
+
+---
+ video/filter/vf_d3d11vpp.c | 9 +++++++++
+ 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)
+
+diff --git a/video/filter/vf_d3d11vpp.c b/video/filter/vf_d3d11vpp.c
